    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disillusioned young man, shackled by the mediocrity of adulthood, unexpectedly time-warps back to his student years, awakening the enigmatic \u200b<strong>Temporal Romance Strategy System</strong>. Guided by his roguish wingman Tong Jincheng, he navigates parallel timelines spanning naive campus days and cutthroat corporate warfare, leveraging future memories to rewrite destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven women become entangled in his chrono-disrupted journey \u2013 the childhood friend harboring silent devotion, the college sweetheart turned industry rival, the protegee who outgrows her mentor. Witness their metamorphosis: from chalk-dusted classrooms to glass-walled boardrooms, from shared e-bike commutes to the roar of AMG engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As temporal ripples amplify every choice, can this accidental time architect balance equations of ambition and affection? The system demands a verdict: corporate empire or love's singularity?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disillusioned young man, shackled by the mediocrity of adulthood, unexpectedly time-warps back to his student years, awakening the enigmatic \u200b<strong>Temporal Romance Strategy System</strong>. Guided by his roguish wingman Tong Jincheng, he navigates parallel timelines spanning naive campus days and cutthroat corporate warfare, leveraging future memories to rewrite destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven women become entangled in his chrono-disrupted journey \u2013 the childhood friend harboring silent devotion, the college sweetheart turned industry rival, the protegee who outgrows her mentor. Witness their metamorphosis: from chalk-dusted classrooms to glass-walled boardrooms, from shared e-bike commutes to the roar of AMG engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As temporal ripples amplify every choice, can this accidental time architect balance equations of ambition and affection? The system demands a verdict: corporate empire or love's singularity?</p>",
